Acknowledgements (no code derived)
----------------------------------

The projects below informed algorithmic choices. No source file of theirs was read for, copied
into or ported to hekit, so their licenses impose no notice; they are listed for credit only.

- Lattigo (https://github.com/tuneinsight/lattigo, Apache-2.0): the baby-step split rule of
  the level-optimal Chebyshev evaluation (crates/ckks-train-ckks/src/bootstrap/poly.rs,
  optimal_split), a cost formula known from the Lattigo implementation of Bossuat, Mouchet,
  Troncoso-Pastoriza and Hubaux (Eurocrypt 2021), reimplemented from the formula.


